      "content": "it's just hard to see a way out when everything looks so fine. people look at me and see a successful life, so they dont get it. when i tell them i'm struggling, they just tell me im lucky. it makes me feel like i'm stuck in this loop forever. is there ever actually an end to feeling like this? like, is there any way to just... find peace from the noise?",
